{"game": "scp-abhorrent", "language": "english", "appid": 1884750, "month": "2023-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1685577600, "end_date": 1688169599, "month_true_total": 3, "quota": 3, "returned": 3, "pulled_at": "2026-09-10 17:07:39 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "140865464", "author": {"steamid": "76561198274162183", "personaname": "the expert exterminator", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AlexRVA/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 57, "playtime_forever": 67, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 33, "last_played": 1698113634, "avatar": "9182e22d7d420b10a4b44e4a161f559a55e92c35"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have no idea what to do and I cannot beat it. You have to \"find the ladder\" after, presumably, beating Hope(?). I spoil such a fight because the cutscene ends extremely abruptly and it's better to be ready.\n\nAbhorrent is the appropriate title, but the beginning cutscene was funny.\n\nUPDATE: \nI decided to go back in for a video and I beat the game. Beating Hope is not necessary, as it seems the map is randomly generated. \nIn the end, I felt a sense of satisfaction, and I felt as though the game is less of a proper game and more of a \"college kids got bored and made a mini project about something they like\" game. SCP-363 is an interesting SCP to make the game about, too. \nIn the end, although I don't necessarily recommend it still, it's completely free and it can be beat in under 30 minutes. Try it yourself.", "timestamp_created": 1687980887, "timestamp_updated": 1688687456, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "140223883", "author": {"steamid": "76561199036085855", "personaname": "turtle", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/turtlesinacave/", "num_games_owned": 107, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 12, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12, "last_played": 1687016896, "avatar": "3a7231698ba8f3c48a25fbacf70090d1a88cbbf5"}, "language": "english", "review": "more like SCP-ab 'horrible'          this sucks so bad. don't play it", "timestamp_created": 1687017178, "timestamp_updated": 1781417756, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.536178112030029297", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "139928602", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972082582", "personaname": "demon_monkey1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972082582/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 278, "playtime_forever": 9, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9, "last_played": 1686548824, "avatar": "15a8b7cfe22459380954ff4d89963aa01b0cf1d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "The gameplay and graphics are terrible, but the opening cutscene amused me. It reminded me of Red vs. Blue for some reason.", "timestamp_created": 1686548883, "timestamp_updated": 1686548883, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": []}]}